    <published>2020-03-29T15:09:21.000Z</published>
    <summary>Hexo 的第一篇文章，记录日常写作最常用的几条命令：新建文章、本地预览、生成静态文件与部署。</summary>
    <title>Hello World</title>
    <updated>2026-10-14T03:00:00.000Z</updated>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <author>
      <name>Luog</name>
    </author>
    <category term="教程" scheme="https://luoguang.github.io/page/categories/%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/"/>
    <category term="Hexo" scheme="https://luoguang.github.io/page/tags/Hexo/"/>
    <category term="NexT" scheme="https://luoguang.github.io/page/tags/NexT/"/>
    <category term="主题配置" scheme="https://luoguang.github.io/page/tags/%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%98%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/"/>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p>本文记录本站搭建过程中的几个常用设置：添加「关于」页面、开启文章搜索、显示阅读进度，以及首页摘要的截断方式。</p><span id="more"></span><h2 id="添加「关于」页面"><a href="#添加「关于」页面" class="headerlink" title="添加「关于」页面"></a>添加「关于」页面</h2><p>由于使用的是 NexT 主题，两步就够了：</p><ol><li><p>通过 Hexo 新建索引页：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash">hexo new page <span class="token string">"about"</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre></li><li><p>在主题配置 <code>_config.next.yml</code> 的 <code>menu</code> 中加上 <code>about</code> 一行（本站已开启）：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-yaml" data-language="yaml"><code class="language-yaml"><span class="token key atrule">menu</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>  <span class="token key atrule">home</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> / <span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token punctuation">|</span> fa fa<span class="token punctuation">-</span>home  <span class="token key atrule">about</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> /about/ <span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token punctuation">|</span> fa fa<span class="token punctuation">-</span>user  <span class="token key atrule">tags</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> /tags/ <span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token punctuation">|</span> fa fa<span class="token punctuation">-</span>tags  <span class="token key atrule">archives</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> /archives/ <span class="token punctuation">|</span><span class="token punctuation">|</span> fa fa<span class="token punctuation">-</span>archive<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre></li></ol><p>在首页添加其他页面，照猫画虎就行。</p><blockquote><p>主题配置统一写在站点根目录的 <code>_config.next.yml</code>，不要改 <code>themes/next/_config.yml</code>，否则升级主题时会被覆盖。</p></blockquote><h2 id="开启文章搜索"><a href="#开启文章搜索" class="headerlink" title="开启文章搜索"></a>开启文章搜索</h2><p>首先安装插件，在博客根目录执行：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">npm</span> <span class="token function">install</span> hexo-generator-searchdb <span class="token parameter variable">--save</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>然后在站点配置文件 <code>_config.yml</code> 中添加：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-yaml" data-language="yaml"><code class="language-yaml"><span class="token key atrule">search</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>  <span class="token key atrule">path</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> search.xml  <span class="token key atrule">field</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> post  <span class="token key atrule">content</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token boolean important">true</span>  <span class="token key atrule">format</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> html  <span class="token key atrule">limit</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token number">10000</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>最后在主题配置文件 <code>_config.next.yml</code> 中找到 <code>local_search</code>，确认启用，其他项按需调整：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-yaml" data-language="yaml"><code class="language-yaml"><span class="token key atrule">local_search</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>  <span class="token key atrule">enable</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token boolean important">true</span>  <span class="token comment"># 每篇文章最多显示的匹配条数，-1 表示不限</span>  <span class="token key atrule">top_n_per_article</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token number">1</span>  <span class="token key atrule">unescape</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token boolean important">false</span>  <span class="token key atrule">preload</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token boolean important">false</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>侧边栏就会出现搜索框。</p><blockquote><p>注意：安装 <code>hexo-generator-searchdb</code> 时若报错，请根据提示修复相关依赖，否则搜索框可能显示异常。</p></blockquote><h2 id="显示阅读进度"><a href="#显示阅读进度" class="headerlink" title="显示阅读进度"></a>显示阅读进度</h2><p>在主题配置文件 <code>_config.next.yml</code> 中开启（本站当前未启用，需要时加上即可）：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-yaml" data-language="yaml"><code class="language-yaml"><span class="token key atrule">reading_progress</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>  <span class="token key atrule">enable</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token boolean important">true</span>  <span class="token comment"># 可选值：top | bottom</span>  <span class="token key atrule">position</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> top  <span class="token key atrule">color</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">"#37c6c0"</span>  <span class="token key atrule">height</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> 2px<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h2 id="首页摘要截断"><a href="#首页摘要截断" class="headerlink" title="首页摘要截断"></a>首页摘要截断</h2><p>在文章中单独一行插入 <code>&lt;!-- more --&gt;</code>，首页只显示它之前的内容，并出现「阅读全文」按钮：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-markdown" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown"><span class="token comment">&lt;!-- more --></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>正文里直接写这一行即可，不需要转义。</p>]]>
